#, no-c-format
msgid "Transparent graphs' background"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file knetload.kcfg line 58
#: rc.cpp:227
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this option is set to true, the graphs will not have a background; "
"instead, they take the background of the system tray area.\n"
"Note: after changing this option you need to restart KNetLoad."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file knetload.kcfg line 62
#: rc.cpp:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "Update interval (in msecs)"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file knetload.kcfg line 63
#: rc.cpp:234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The interval between two reads of the interface's network load in "
"milliseconds."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file knetload.kcfg line 67
#: rc.cpp:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show one graph above the other"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file knetload.kcfg line 69
#: rc.cpp:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is set, the graphs of a single interface will be shown one on "
"top of the other, instead of one at side of the other (if the panel is "
"horizontal).\n"
"If the panel is vertical, they will be shown one at side of the other "
"instead of one under the other."
msgstr ""

